WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Log in, explore opportunities for your college and major, and submit an application.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
The company accepts or rejects your application. Confirm only one accepted internship offer.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Your company supervisor assigns tasks with deadlines and evaluation criteria. Submit your completed work.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
Read the company supervisor's feedback, make requested revisions, and resubmit your work.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
The company records training hours. Your academic supervisor verifies them separately from task grades.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
The company and academic supervisor send their final evaluations. The coordinator reviews all completion requirements.

00:32.000 --> 00:34.000
After approval, receive your completion message and download or print your internship certificate.
